<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>michi runs</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #fbfaf8; --panel: #ffffff; --ink: #1c1b1a; --muted: #6b6764;
    --line: #e6e2dc; --accent: #b23a30; --high: #c0392b; --warn: #b8860b;
    --info: #7a7570; --good: #2e7d32;
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    :root {
      --bg: #17161a; --panel: #1e1d22; --ink: #ece9e4; --muted: #a09a94;
      --line: #302e35; --accent: #e2645a; --high: #e2645a; --warn: #d4a548;
      --info: #8b8580; --good: #6aab6e;
    }
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin: 0; padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem 5rem; background: var(--bg); color: var(--ink);
    font: 15px/1.6 ui-sans-serif, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
  }
  .wrap { max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; }
  header { border-bottom: 2px solid var(--line); padding-bottom: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .brand { font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
  .brand .kanji { color: var(--accent); margin-right: .4rem; }
  .sub { color: var(--muted); margin-top: .25rem; }
  h2 { font-size: 1rem; margin: 2.5rem 0 .3rem; font-weight: 650; }
  h2 .mono { color: var(--accent); }
  .meta { color: var(--muted); font-size: .84rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .card { background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px;
          overflow: hidden; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
  th { text-align: left; font-size: .74rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .07em;
       color: var(--muted); padding: .8rem 1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
       font-weight: 600; }
  td { padding: .7rem 1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
  .num { text-align: right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .mono { font-family: ui-monospace, "SF Mono", Menlo, monospace; font-size: .88rem; }
  .leader { font-weight: 700; color: var(--good); }
  .tied { color: var(--warn); }
  .muted { color: var(--muted); }
  .note { color: var(--muted); font-size: .85rem; margin-top: 2rem;
          border-left: 3px solid var(--line); padding-left: 1rem; }
  footer { margin-top: 3rem; padding-top: 1.2rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
           color: var(--muted); font-size: .82rem; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">

<header>
  <div class="brand"><span class="kanji">道</span>michi runs</div>
  <div class="sub">{{ total }} recorded run{{ "" if total == 1 else "s" }} across {{ groups|length }} dataset/target group{{ "" if groups|length == 1 else "s" }}</div>
</header>

{% for item in groups %}
<h2><span class="mono">{{ item.group.dataset }}</span> — target <span class="mono">{{ item.group.target }}</span></h2>
<div class="meta">
  {{ item.group.task }} · {{ item.rows|length }} runs · ranked by {{ item.group.primary_metric }} ·
  data <span class="mono">{{ item.group.dataset_sha[:16] }}</span>
</div>
<div class="card">
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr><th>run</th><th>model</th><th>kind</th>
          <th class="num">{{ item.group.primary_metric }}</th>
          <th class="num">95% interval</th><th>verdict</th><th>when</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
    {% for row in item.rows %}
      <tr>
        <td class="mono muted">{{ row.short_id }}</td>
        <td class="mono">{{ row.model }}</td>
        <td class="muted">{{ row.kind }}</td>
        <td class="num">{{ row.value }}</td>
        <td class="num muted">{{ row.interval }}</td>
        <td class="{% if row.verdict == 'leader' %}leader{% elif 'tied' in row.verdict %}tied{% else %}muted{% endif %}">{{ row.verdict }}</td>
        <td class="muted mono">{{ row.created_at }}</td>
      </tr>
    {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>
{% endfor %}

<div class="note">
  Runs are grouped by dataset content hash and target, because only runs over
  the same rows predicting the same thing are comparable. A verdict appears
  where the run recorded a significance comparison — benchmark runs do; single
  evaluations have nothing to compare against.
</div>

<footer>generated by michi · every number here is reproducible from its manifest</footer>

</div>
</body>
</html>
